The SQL script initializes the table schema with constraints and injects a single valid data row:
```sql
CREATE TABLE LIBRARY_BOOKS (
  BookID INT PRIMARY KEY,
  Title VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL,
  Author VARCHAR(50),
  Price DECIMAL(6,2)
);
INSERT INTO LIBRARY_BOOKS (BookID, Title, Author, Price) VALUES (101, 'Data Science', 'Alan Turing', 450.50);
```
